   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Netherlands Enterprise Agency</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Introducing new online e-commerce and digital solutions to Bosnia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Bosnia, the marketing sector is mainly active in newspapers, radio, television and billboards. The use of e-commerce is coming up in Bosnia next to these traditional media. New IT applications adapted to the Bosnian demands are needed to support further grow of this sector.This project aims is to provide Bosnian clients and broader regional Balkan clients with two new tools which are compatible to use in e-commerce in Bosnia. Tool 1 is a PR marketing and monitoring package. With this package companies can assess the effectiveness of online activities such as marketing campaigns and brand management through Bosnian or other Balkan countries within the demanded time frames of clients. Tool 2 is an auction package. With this package Bosnian clients can digitally set up a regulated auction.The partners will be applicant S5 B.V. MERKwaardige Specialisten and local partner Via Media d.o.o. They will set up a joint venture company in Sarajevo. The project can provide a Bosnian company to step into this new market. It will provide good skilled jobs, it helps the marketing sector to better sell the local advertisement channels and it helps companies to sell local products through digital auctions and public procurement for example with tenders.</narrative>
  </description>
